omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vyZTUj9VIkMQ7kNvwFEQ9qv&_nc_oc=Adot2ZuuYEvsCKINt6XBN0WTcUzNhacumyf3a4SkV8bc6LU5nq9eNQ8gIW8Lzu7mMuw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyfB53VyTXcEBiyJtSquvP9drzQm_02pNsZcTznSyZUwg&oe=69CCFFF4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o8v1DNI60OAQ7kNvwHGWx9j&_nc_oc=AdqUVAqv3gtkw2iqt3f-vM4Vs_oWn__XUEMNzlmacESZYX5FFi0hTAaEv0Gs7R9O0bk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afwh9dhkfuUM32RbtRs_2r9AaZdgSQsdtE4aMAqnfoAVvA&oe=69CD0156"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=svCj30hxt0MQ7kNvwFlYEH9&_nc_oc=AdpZDjE3Fin9E2EJuzAd2zp3ZtcNOeeZgxd34W_aE7WmNZAXSZ0hLD0bha8l9gU5VZA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzfvtcSObB6gekPMG4UjGBkFa6e2ai3xjsGbjKonKeK4g&oe=69CD1677"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://